1],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Significantly easier to use and set up.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; Users consistently rate Lyssna higher for ease of use (9.1 vs 8.4), ease of setup (9.2 vs 8.5), and ease of administration (8.9 vs 8.5) compared to Dscout. Teams find Lyssna’s interface more intuitive with a faster learning curve, making it accessible for both experienced researchers and non-researchers. This improved ease of use translates to faster time-to-insights and broader adoption across organizations.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;listitem&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;value&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,1],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Transparent, accessible pricing.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; Lyssna offers clear, published pricing starting at $166/month, while Dscout requires scheduling a demo for custom quotes and only reveals pricing through sales conversations. This transparency allows teams to budget effectively and scale predictably without navigating enterprise sales cycles or unexpected costs.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;listitem&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;value&quot;:[0,2]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,1],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Faster research cycles and validation.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; Lyssna&#39;s self-service model and instant panel access deliver results in hours, not days or weeks. Studies can be launched immediately without sales calls, making it easy to validate critical decisions quickly. Dscout&#39;s focus on diary studies and field research typically involves longer timelines of days to weeks. For teams needing rapid validation at key decision points, Lyssna&#39;s speed and accessibility enable timely user feedback without the delays of managed research services.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;listitem&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;value&quot;:[0,3]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;list&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,1],&quot;listType&quot;:[0,&quot;number&quot;],&quot;start&quot;:[0,1],&quot;tag&quot;:[0,&quot;ol&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,1],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;What really sets Lyssna apart is removing barriers to regular research.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;st