 that includes unlimited quick studies and three seats, so you can run studies with your own participants at no cost. Dscout doesn&#39;t offer a free plan or trial – accessing the platform requires scheduling a demo.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;paragraph&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,0],&quot;textStyle&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;68e70d4bb30bfc460c71c1f3&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;What is the pricing difference between Lyssna and Dscout? &quot;],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;accordionItem&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,{&quot;root&quot;:[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Lyssna offers a free plan and a Growth plan from $165/month (billed annually), with panel recruitment at $1 per credit. Dscout requires scheduling a demo for custom pricing with no published rates, and participant costs are also only available on request. For teams who need to budget research costs in advance, Lyssna&#39;s published pricing provides better predictability.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;paragraph&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,0],&quot;textStyle&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;68e70d4bb30bfc460c71c1f4&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Which platform has better customer support: Lyssna or Dscout? &quot;],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;accordionItem&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,{&quot;root&quot;:[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;According to &quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;G2 reviews,&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;link&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,3],&quot;fields&quot;:[0,{&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://www.g2.com/compare/dscout-vs-lyssna&quot;],&quot;newTab&quot;:[0,true],&quot;linkType&quot;:[0,&quot;custom&quot;]}],&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6a7ea724dd779f1e3cf1d1c6&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; Dscout slightly edges out Lyssna for quality of support. However, Lyssna provides both email support and live chat for all users, while Dscout offers email support and project management assistance but no live chat option. Both platforms receive high ratings for support quality.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;paragraph&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,0],&quot;textStyle&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;68e70d4bb30bfc460c71c1f5&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Which is easier to use: Lyssna or Dscout? &quot;],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;accordionItem&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,{&quot;root&quot;:[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Lyssna scores higher for ease of use , ease of setup, and ease of administration on &quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;G2&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;link&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,3],&quot;fields&quot;:[0,{&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://www.g2.com/compare/dscout-vs-lyssna&quot;],&quot;newTab&quot;:[0,true],&quot;linkType&quot;:[0,&quot;custom&quot;]}],&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6a7ea744dd779f1e3cf1d1c7&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;. Users report that Lyssna&#39;s interface has a shorter learning curve compared to Dscout, making it more accessible for both researchers and non-researchers.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;paragraph&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,0],&quot;textStyle&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;68e70d4bb30bfc460c71c1f6&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;How do research timelines compare between Lyssna and Dscout? &quot;],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;accordionItem&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,{&quot;root&quot;:[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;Lyssna’s &quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;unmoderated research methods&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;link&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,3],&quot;fields&quot;:[0,{&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;/blog/unmoderated-usability-testing/&quot;],&quot;newTab&quot;:[0,true],&quot;linkType&quot;:[0,&quot;custom&quot;]}],&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;690152876c18dacf8ca6855e&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; typically deliver results within hours through instant &quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}],[0,{&quot;children&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot;panel access&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,null],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;link&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,3],&quot;fields&quot;:[0,{&quot;linkType&quot;:[0,&quot;custom&quot;],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://&quot;]}],&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;690152a16c18dacf8ca6855f&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;detail&quot;:[0,0],&quot;format&quot;:[0,0],&quot;mode&quot;:[0,&quot;normal&quot;],&quot;style&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:[0,&quot; and automated analysis. Dscout’s diary studies and field research usually run for several days to weeks, as they’re designed to capture behaviors and experiences over time. Choose Lyssna for rapid validation and iterative testing, or Dscout for longitudinal qualitative insights.&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;text&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;paragraph&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1],&quot;textFormat&quot;:[0,0],&quot;textStyle&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}]]],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;infoAccordion&quot;]}]}]]],&quot;direction&quot;:[0,&quot;ltr&quot;],&quot;format&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;indent&quot;:[0,0],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;root&quot;],&quot;version&quot;:[0,1]}]}]}" ssr client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;RichText&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><h2 id="why-companies-choose-lyssna-over-dscout" class="font-grenette lg:text-title-xl text-m-title-xl not-first:mt-[44px] max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] lg:px-0 lg:not-first:mt-20 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-h)+20px)] mx-auto box-content text-left">Why companies choose Lyssna over Dscout </h2><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left">Teams evaluating user research platforms consistently cite three key factors that lead them to choose Lyssna over Dscout:</p><ol class="pl-7 text-[13px] max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] lg:text-[14px] list-decimal mx-auto"><li><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left"><strong>Significantly easier to use and set up.</strong> Users consistently rate Lyssna higher for ease of use (9.1 vs 8.4), ease of setup (9.2 vs 8.5), and ease of administration (8.9 vs 8.5) compared to Dscout. Teams find Lyssna’s interface more intuitive with a faster learning curve, making it accessible for both experienced researchers and non-researchers. This improved ease of use translates to faster time-to-insights and broader adoption across organizations.</p></li><li><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left"><strong>Transparent, accessible pricing.</strong> Lyssna offers clear, published pricing starting at $166/month, while Dscout requires scheduling a demo for custom quotes and only reveals pricing through sales conversations. This transparency allows teams to budget effectively and scale predictably without navigating enterprise sales cycles or unexpected costs.</p></li><li><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left"><strong>Faster research cycles and validation.</strong> Lyssna's self-service model and instant panel access deliver results in hours, not days or weeks. Studies can be launched immediately without sales calls, making it easy to validate critical decisions quickly. Dscout's focus on diary studies and field research typically involves longer timelines of days to weeks. For teams needing rapid validation at key decision points, Lyssna's speed and accessibility enable timely user feedback without the delays of managed research services.</p></li></ol><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left"><strong>What really sets Lyssna apart is removing barriers to regular research.</strong> While Dscout specializes in in-depth longitudinal qualitative studies with custom enterprise pricing, Lyssna makes professional <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/blog/best-ux-research-tools/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">user research tools</a> available to teams of all sizes throus ugh transparent pricing and instant self-service capabilities. </p><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] mx-auto mt-4 lg:mt-5 box-content text-left">For organizations that need to validate decisions quickly and frequently, Lyssna's model makes regular user research feasible and sustainable.</p><h2 id="lyssna-vs-dscout-key-differences" class="font-grenette lg:text-title-xl text-m-title-xl not-first:mt-[44px] max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] lg:px-0 lg:not-first:mt-20 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-h)+20px)] mx-auto box-content text-left">Lyssna vs Dscout: Key differences</h2><div class="my-10 lg:max-w-[660px] max-w-[630px] grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mx-auto  "><div><div class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><img src="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbi9MeXNzbmEtcGxhbnMtTHlzc25hLXZzLU1hemUud2VicA/w3840q75.webp" srcset="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbi9MeXNzbmEtcGxhbnMtTHlzc25hLXZzLU1hemUud2VicA/w3840q75.webp 1x" alt="Lyssna vs Maze" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="4800" height="3200" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md"/></div><br/><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><strong>Pricing transparency and accessibility</strong></p><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left">Lyssna offers <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/pricing/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">transparent pricing</a> with a free plan and a Growth plan from $16/month (billed annually). Dscout requires scheduling a demo for custom pricing with no published rates. The same applies to participant recruitment costs – Lyssna publishes its panel pricing at $1 per credit, while Dscout's participant costs are only available on request.</p></div><div><div class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><img src="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbjEwLzIxMjMwMTY5X3VubW9kZXJhdGVkLXRlc3RzLndlYnA/w3840q75.webp" srcset="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbjEwLzIxMjMwMTY5X3VubW9kZXJhdGVkLXRlc3RzLndlYnA/w3840q75.webp 1x" alt="unmoderated-tests.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="4800" height="3200" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md"/></div><br/><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><strong>Research methodology focus</strong></p><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left">Lyssna provides unmoderated research methods including <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/usability-testing/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">usability testing</a>, <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/card-sorting/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">card sorting</a>, <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/tree-testing/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">tree testing</a>, <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/five-second-testing/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">five second testing</a>, <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/prototype-testing/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">prototype testing</a>, and <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/user-interviews/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">user interviews</a> – ideal for evaluating designs and validating decisions throughout development. Dscout focuses on longitudinal qualitative research through diary studies, field studies, and mobile ethnography to capture in-context behaviors over extended periods.</p></div><div><div class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><img src="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbi9maXZlLXNlY29uZC10ZXN0LndlYnA/w3840q75.webp" srcset="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbi9maXZlLXNlY29uZC10ZXN0LndlYnA/w3840q75.webp 1x" alt="comparison" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="4800" height="3200" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md"/></div><br/><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><strong>Speed to insights</strong></p><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left">With Lyssna’s self-service model, teams can launch studies and receive results within hours. Dscout's diary studies and field research typically run for days to weeks, reflecting their focus on capturing in-context behaviors over time. This fundamental difference makes Lyssna better suited for iterative design work and rapid decision making, while Dscout excels at understanding user journeys and behaviors in natural settings.</p></div><div><div class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><img src="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbjEwLzIxMjMwMTY4X3Jlc2VhcmNoLXBhbmVsLndlYnA/w3840q75.webp" srcset="/images/aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy51cy1lYXN0LTEuYW1hem9uYXdzLmNvbS9seXNzbmEtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1tYXJrZXRpbmctc2l0ZS1hc3NldHMvbWFpbjEwLzIxMjMwMTY4X3Jlc2VhcmNoLXBhbmVsLndlYnA/w3840q75.webp 1x" alt="research-panel.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-fade-in width="4800" height="3200" class="[html.js_&amp;]:not-data-loaded:opacity-[0.01] transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none rounded-md"/></div><br/><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left"><strong>Panel ownership and access</strong></p><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] text-left">Lyssna owns and operates its <a data-astro-prefetch="hover" href="/features/research-panel/" class="text-green-02 lg:hover:text-green-03 underline lg:hover:underline-offset-[3px]">research panel</a> of 690,000+ participants with instant self-service access and 395+ demographic targeting options. Dscout uses a hybrid approach combining their Scout panel with partnerships through third-party providers. While Dscout offers flexibility in recruitment sources, Lyssna’s unified panel provides consistency and simplicity in participant quality and pricing.</p></div></div><h2 id="lyssna-vs-dscout-feature-comparison" class="font-grenette lg:text-title-xl text-m-title-xl not-first:mt-[44px] max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] lg:px-0 lg:not-first:mt-20 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-h)+20px)] mx-auto box-content text-left">Lyssna vs Dscout: Feature comparison</h2><div class="my-10 overflow-y-hidden rounded-md lg:rounded-xl mx-auto lg:px-18.75 lg:max-w-[660px] max-w-[630px] box-content "><table class="mb-2.5 min-w-full lg:mb-6"><thead class="bg-neutral-06"><tr><th scope="col" class="sm:max-w-auto max-w-[144px] px-[14px] py-[14px] text-left first:rounded-tl-md last:rounded-tr-md lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 lg:first:rounded-tl-xl lg:last:rounded-tr-xl"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line font-medium">Feature</p></th><th scope="col" class="sm:max-w-auto max-w-[144px] px-[14px] py-[14px] text-left first:rounded-tl-md last:rounded-tr-md lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 lg:first:rounded-tl-xl lg:last:rounded-tr-xl"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line font-medium">Lyssna</p></th><th scope="col" class="sm:max-w-auto max-w-[144px] px-[14px] py-[14px] text-left first:rounded-tl-md last:rounded-tr-md lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 lg:first:rounded-tl-xl lg:last:rounded-tr-xl"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line font-medium">Dscout</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line">Free plan features</p></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"></div></td></tr><tr class="bg-neutral-06"><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line">Seats included</p></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><div class="relative aspect-square inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 lg:w-7"><svg stroke