e-flex items-center justify-center w-6 lg:w-7"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 29 28" role="img" aria-label="Included" class="fill-none h-7 w-7"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#green-tick"></use></svg></div></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 "><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><div class="relative aspect-square inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 lg:w-7"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 29 28" role="img" aria-label="Included" class="fill-none h-7 w-7"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#green-tick"></use></svg></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 first:rounded-bl-md last:rounded-br-md lg:first:rounded-bl-xl lg:last:rounded-br-xl"><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><p class="font-mint lg:text-body-s text-m-body-s whitespace-pre-line">SSO</p></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 first:rounded-bl-md last:rounded-br-md lg:first:rounded-bl-xl lg:last:rounded-br-xl"><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><div class="relative aspect-square inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 lg:w-7"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 29 28" role="img" aria-label="Included" class="fill-none h-7 w-7"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#green-tick"></use></svg></div></div></td><td class="px-[14px] py-[14px] lg:px-6 lg:py-4.5 first:rounded-bl-md last:rounded-br-md lg:first:rounded-bl-xl lg:last:rounded-br-xl"><div class="flex gap-2 items-start"><div class="relative aspect-square inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 lg:w-7"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 29 28" role="img" aria-label="Included" class="fill-none h-7 w-7"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#green-tick"></use></svg></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id="fa-qs-about-lyssna-vs-dscout" class="font-grenette lg:text-title-xl text-m-title-xl not-first:mt-[44px] max-w-[630px] lg:max-w-[660px] lg:px-0 lg:not-first:mt-20 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-h)+20px)] mx-auto box-content text-left">FAQs about Lyssna vs Dscout</h2><div class="mx-auto max-w-[630px] pb-20 pt-[26px] lg:max-w-[850px] lg:pt-[62px]"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Lyssna offer a free trial or free plan? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Lyssna offers a free plan that includes unlimited quick studies and three seats, so you can run studies with your own participants at no cost. Dscout doesn't offer a free plan or trial – accessing the platform requires scheduling a demo."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the pricing difference between Lyssna and Dscout? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lyssna offers a free plan and a Growth plan from $165/month (billed annually), with panel recruitment at $1 per credit. Dscout requires scheduling a demo for custom pricing with no published rates, and participant costs are also only available on request. For teams who need to budget research costs in advance, Lyssna's published pricing provides better predictability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which platform has better customer support: Lyssna or Dscout? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"According to G2 reviews, Dscout slightly edges out Lyssna for quality of support. However, Lyssna provides both email support and live chat for all users, while Dscout offers email support and project management assistance but no live chat option. Both platforms receive high ratings for support quality."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is easier to use: Lyssna or Dscout? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lyssna scores higher for ease of use , ease of setup, and ease of administration on G2. Users report that Lyssna's interface has a shorter learning curve compared to Dscout, making it more accessible for both researchers and non-researchers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do research timelines compare between Lyssna and Dscout? ","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lyssna’s unmoderated research methods typically deliver results within hours through instant panel access and automated analysis. Dscout’s diary studies and field research usually run for several days to weeks, as they’re designed to capture behaviors and experiences over time. Choose Lyssna for rapid validation and iterative testing, or Dscout for longitudinal qualitative insights."}}]}</script><div data-animate class="flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-neutral-05 px-4 py-6 first:pt-4.5 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0 lg:py-8 lg:first:pt-5 "><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-P12-0" class="w-full cursor-pointer bg-transparent text-left"><span class="relative flex w-full justify-between gap-6 lg:gap-[38px] lg:pt-0"><span class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s font-medium">Does Lyssna offer a free trial or free plan? </span><span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] bg-neutral-06 lg:h-9 lg:w-9 lg:rounded-md"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 16 3" aria-hidden="true" class="fill-none w-4 scale-[0.75] text-neutral-01 lg:scale-100"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#minus"></use></svg><span class="absolute"><svg stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 16 3" aria-hidden="true" class="fill-none w-4 scale-[0.75] text-neutral-01 lg:scale-100"><use href="/_astro/symbols.Rv3yHajH.svg#minus"></use></svg></span></span></span></span></button><div id="accordion-panel-P12-0" class="overflow-hidden"></div></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-05 px-4 py-6 first:pt-4.5 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0 lg:py-8 lg:first:pt-5 "><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-P12-1" class="w-full cursor-pointer bg-transparent text-left"><span class="relative flex w-full justify-between gap-6 lg:gap-[38px] "><span class="font-mint lg:text-heading-s text-m-heading-s font-medium">What is the pricing difference between Lyssna and Dscout? </span><span><span class="flex h-7 w-7 it